# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately tracked, listed here so nobody adds a rule that kills them:
#
#   sim/*.png       the README embeds these; ignoring them breaks the page
#   docs/images/*   hardware photographs and the runtime clip, embedded
#   docs/video/*    the full-length capture the GIF is cut from
#   sdcard/*.txt    the u-boot override is source, not output
#   quartus/*.qsf   project settings
#   quartus/*.qpf   project file
#   quartus/*.sdc   timing constraints
#   quartus/*.tcl   pin assignments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

